\\frac{133}{20}
   z^4\\right)+\\left(\\frac{37}{4}+\\frac{1}{2} z^2+\\frac{7}{2} z^3\\right) \
w+\\left(\\frac{47}{5}+1 z^2+3 z^4\\right)
   w^2+\\left(-\\frac{189}{20}-\\frac{3}{2} z^3\\right) \
w^4+\\left(-\\frac{23}{10}-\\frac{7}{2} z^2\\right)
   w^5+\\left(-\\frac{779}{60}+\\frac{3}{4} z+4 z^2+3 z^3-\\frac{1}{3} \
z^4\\right) w^6+\\left(-\\frac{17}{2}+1 z^2-\\frac{3}{4}
   z^{12}\\right) w^7\
\>", "Output",
